## [Detecting and analyzing faces](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/rekognition/latest/dg/faces.md)

- [Overview of face detection and face comparison](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/rekognition/latest/dg/face-feature-differences.md): Amazon Rekognition provides users access to two primary machine learning applications for images containing faces: face detection and face comparison.
